logic: Missing `key` prop for list item. Should be `key={key}` to prevent React rendering issues.

```suggestion
                <GrafanaRuleListItem
                  key={key}
                  rule={rule}
                  groupIdentifier={groupIdentifier}
                  namespaceName={ruleWithOrigin.namespaceName}
                  showLocation={true}
                />
```
